  "description": "The rate that converts one Currency into the base currency FOR ONE PERIOD. Deliberately its own object rather than a field on Currency: a rate is a fact about a currency AND a point in time, and recalculating March must use March's rate, not today's. A rate stored on Currency would silently rewrite history every time finance updated it.",
